        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-google-blue transition-colors text-sm">Foundations & Principles</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-google-gray mt-1 line-clamp-2" id="q1Desc">Core rules, audit teardowns, and framework basics.</p>
